==================================================
II. PRODUCT MISSION
==================================================

Build Victoroff.ai into a trusted conversational intelligence layer
for shareholder and community opportunity, education, navigation,
and cultural continuity.

The system should eventually allow ordinary-language questions such as:

"What benefits might be available to me?"

"What scholarships are open?"

"What jobs are available?"

"Are there financial literacy workshops?"

"Can I receive help with vocational education?"

"What opportunities am I missing?"

"Teach me Dena'ina."

"Quiz me on what I learned yesterday."

"Where did this information come from?"

The user should not need to understand organisational structures,
programme names, website navigation, or institutional bureaucracy
before asking for help.


